# Git commit messages

- Do not add extra `Co-authored-by:` trailers unless the user explicitly asks for co-authors.
- If tooling appends authorship trailers you did not intend, fix the commit message before pushing.
- Prefer a single author line matching the repository owner unless the user asks otherwise.
